    "A TLS certificate fingerprint requires a secure gateway URL.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A TLS certificate fingerprint requires a secure gateway URL."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TLS 证书指纹需要安全的 Gateway URL。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TLS 憑證指紋需要安全的 Gateway URL。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uma impressão digital de certificado TLS exige uma URL segura do Gateway."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ein TLS-Zertifikatsfingerabdruck erfordert eine sichere Gateway-URL."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Una huella digital de certificado TLS requiere una URL segura del Gateway."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TLS証明書のフィンガープリントには、安全なGateway URLが必要です。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TLS 인증서 지문을 사용하려면 보안 Gateway URL이 필요합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Une empreinte de certificat TLS nécessite une URL sécurisée pour le Gateway."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TLS प्रमाणपत्र फ़िंगरप्रिंट के लिए एक सुरक्षित Gateway URL आवश्यक है."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تتطلب بصمة شهادة TLS عنوان URL آمنًا لـ Gateway."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L'impronta digitale di un certificato TLS richiede un URL sicuro del gateway."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TLS sertifikası parmak izi için güvenli bir Gateway URL'si gerekir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Для відбитка сертифіката TLS потрібна захищена URL-адреса Gateway."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sidik jari sertifikat TLS memerlukan URL Gateway yang aman."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odcisk certyfikatu TLS wymaga bezpiecznego adresu URL Gateway."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ลายนิ้วมือใบรับรอง TLS ต้องใช้ URL ของ Gateway ที่ปลอดภัย."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dấu vân tay chứng chỉ TLS yêu cầu URL Gateway bảo mật."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Een TLS-certificaatvingerafdruk vereist een beveiligde gateway-URL."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اثر انگشت گواهی TLS به یک URL امن برای Gateway نیاز دارد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Для отпечатка сертификата TLS требуется защищённый URL Gateway."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ett TLS-certifikatfingeravtryck kräver en säker Gateway-URL."}}}},
    "A previous app version could not safely send this message. Review and retry it.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A previous app version could not safely send this message. Review and retry it."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先前版本的应用无法安全发送此消息。请检查后重试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先前版本的 App 無法安全地傳送此訊息。請檢查後重試。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uma versão anterior do app não conseguiu enviar esta mensagem com segurança. Revise e tente enviá-la novamente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eine frühere App-Version konnte diese Nachricht nicht sicher senden. Prüfe sie und versuche es erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Una versión anterior de la aplicación no pudo enviar este mensaje de forma segura. Revísalo y vuelve a intentarlo."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"以前のバージョンのアプリでは、このメッセージを安全に送信できませんでした。 内容を確認して再試行してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이전 앱 버전에서 이 메시지를 안전하게 전송하지 못했습니다. 검토한 후 다시 시도하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Une version précédente de l’application n’a pas pu envoyer ce message en toute sécurité. Vérifiez-le et réessayez."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ऐप का पिछला संस्करण इस संदेश को सुरक्षित रूप से नहीं भेज सका. इसकी समीक्षा करें और फिर से भेजने का प्रयास करें."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذّر على إصدار سابق من التطبيق إرسال هذه الرسالة بأمان. راجعها وأعد محاولة إرسالها."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Una versione precedente dell'app non ha potuto inviare questo messaggio in modo sicuro. Controllalo e riprova."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uygulamanın önceki bir sürümü bu mesajı güvenli bir şekilde gönderemedi. Gözden geçirip yeniden deneyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Попередня версія застосунку не змогла безпечно надіслати це повідомлення. Перегляньте його та повторіть спробу."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Versi aplikasi sebelumnya tidak dapat mengirim pesan ini dengan aman. Tinjau dan coba kirim ulang."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Poprzednia wersja aplikacji nie mogła bezpiecznie wysłać tej wiadomości. Sprawdź ją i spróbuj ponownie."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"แอปเวอร์ชันก่อนหน้าไม่สามารถส่งข้อความนี้ได้อย่างปลอดภัย. โปรดตรวจสอบแล้วลองส่งอีกครั้ง."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phiên bản ứng dụng trước không thể gửi tin nhắn này một cách an toàn. Hãy xem lại và thử gửi lại."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Een eerdere appversie kon dit bericht niet veilig verzenden. Controleer het en probeer het opnieuw."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نسخهٔ قبلی برنامه نتوانست این پیام را به‌طور ایمن ارسال کند. آن را بررسی کنید و دوباره تلاش کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Предыдущая версия приложения не смогла безопасно отправить это сообщение. Проверьте его и повторите отправку."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En tidigare appversion kunde inte skicka detta meddelande på ett säkert sätt. Granska det och försök igen."}}}},
    "A saved Watch message expired after 48 hours. Check Chat on iPhone.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A saved Watch message expired after 48 hours. Check Chat on iPhone."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一条已保存的 Watch 消息在 48 小时后过期。请在 iPhone 上查看聊天。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已儲存的 Watch 訊息在 48 小時後過期。請查看 iPhone 上的聊天。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uma mensagem salva do Watch expirou após 48 horas. Verifique o Chat no iPhone."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eine gespeicherte Watch-Nachricht ist nach 48 Stunden abgelaufen. Prüfe den Chat auf dem iPhone."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un mensaje guardado de Watch caducó después de 48 horas. Revisa el chat en el iPhone."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保存されたWatchメッセージは48時間後に有効期限が切れました。 iPhoneでチャットを確認してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"저장된 Watch 메시지가 48시간 후 만료되었습니다. iPhone에서 채팅을 확인하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un message Watch enregistré a expiré après 48 heures. Consultez la discussion sur iPhone."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Watch पर सहेजे गए एक संदेश की समय-सीमा 48 घंटे बाद समाप्त हो गई. iPhone पर चैट देखें."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"انتهت صلاحية رسالة محفوظة من Watch بعد 48 ساعة. تحقق من الدردشة على iPhone."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un messaggio salvato su Watch è scaduto dopo 48 ore. Controlla Chat su iPhone."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kaydedilmiş bir Watch mesajının süresi 48 saat sonra doldu. iPhone'da Sohbet'i kontrol edin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Термін дії збереженого повідомлення Watch минув через 48 годин. Перевірте чат на iPhone."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pesan Watch yang tersimpan kedaluwarsa setelah 48 jam. Periksa Obrolan di iPhone."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zapisana wiadomość z Watch wygasła po 48 godzinach. Sprawdź Czat na iPhonie."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ข้อความ Watch ที่บันทึกไว้หมดอายุหลังจาก 48 ชั่วโมง. โปรดตรวจสอบแชทบน iPhone."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Một tin nhắn Watch đã lưu đã hết hạn sau 48 giờ. Hãy kiểm tra mục Trò chuyện trên iPhone."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Een opgeslagen Watch-bericht is na 48 uur verlopen. Controleer Chat op je iPhone."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"یک پیام ذخیره‌شدهٔ Watch پس از 48 ساعت منقضی شد. بخش گفتگو را در iPhone بررسی کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Срок действия сохранённого сообщения Watch истёк через 48 часов. Проверьте чат на iPhone."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ett sparat Watch-meddelande upphörde att gälla efter 48 timmar. Kontrollera Chat på iPhone."}}}},
