    "Approval waiting on your wrist": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approval waiting on your wrist"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手表上有待处理的审批"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手錶上有待核准的請求"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovação pendente no seu pulso"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Genehmigung wartet auf Ihrer Uhr"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobación pendiente en tu muñeca"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手首のデバイスで承認待ち"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"손목의 기기에서 승인 대기 중"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approbation en attente sur votre montre"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपकी घड़ी पर अनुमोदन लंबित है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"طلب موافقة ينتظرك على ساعتك"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvazione in attesa sul tuo polso"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bileğinizde onay bekleniyor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запит на схвалення чекає на вашому годиннику"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persetujuan menunggu di jam tangan Anda"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prośba o zatwierdzenie czeka na zegarku"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"มีคำขอรอการอนุมัติบนนาฬิกาของคุณ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yêu cầu phê duyệt đang chờ trên đồng hồ của bạn"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Goedkeuring wacht op je pols"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"در انتظار تأیید روی ساعت مچی شما"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"На ваших часах ожидается одобрение"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Godkännande väntar på din klocka"}}}},
    "Approvals": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvals"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"审批"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"核准請求"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovações"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Genehmigungen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobaciones"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"承認"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"승인"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approbations"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अनुमोदन"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الموافقات"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvazioni"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Onaylar"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалення"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persetujuan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdzenia"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"รายการอนุมัติ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Các yêu cầu phê duyệt"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Goedkeuringen"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأییدها"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Одобрения"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Godkännanden"}}}},
    "Approve this device on the gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` in your OpenClaw chat\n%2$@\nOpenClaw will also retry automatically when you return to this app.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approve this device on the gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` in your OpenClaw chat\n%2$@\nOpenClaw will also retry automatically when you return to this app."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在网关上批准此设备。\n1) `%1$@`\n2) 在 OpenClaw 聊天中运行 `/pair approve`\n%2$@\n当你返回此应用时，OpenClaw 也会自动重试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 Gateway 上核准此裝置。\n1) `%1$@`\n2) 在您的 OpenClaw 聊天中執行 `/pair approve`\n%2$@\n當您返回此應用程式時，OpenClaw 也會自動重試。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprove este dispositivo no gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` no seu chat do OpenClaw\n%2$@\nO OpenClaw também tentará novamente de forma automática quando você retornar a este aplicativo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Genehmigen Sie dieses Gerät auf dem Gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` in Ihrem OpenClaw-Chat\n%2$@\nOpenClaw versucht es auch automatisch erneut, wenn Sie zu dieser App zurückkehren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprueba este dispositivo en el Gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` en tu chat de OpenClaw\n%2$@\nOpenClaw también lo volverá a intentar automáticamente cuando regreses a esta aplicación."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gatewayでこのデバイスを承認してください.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) OpenClawのチャットで`/pair approve`を実行\n%2$@\nこのアプリに戻ると、OpenClawは自動的に再試行します."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway에서 이 기기를 승인하세요.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) OpenClaw 채팅에서 `/pair approve` 실행\n%2$@\n이 앱으로 돌아오면 OpenClaw가 자동으로 다시 시도합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approuvez cet appareil sur le Gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` dans votre conversation OpenClaw\n%2$@\nOpenClaw réessaiera également automatiquement lorsque vous reviendrez dans cette application."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gateway पर इस डिवाइस को मंज़ूरी दें।\n1) `%1$@`\n2) अपनी OpenClaw चैट में `/pair approve`\n%2$@\nजब आप इस ऐप पर लौटेंगे, तो OpenClaw अपने आप फिर से कोशिश भी करेगा।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"وافق على هذا الجهاز على Gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` في محادثتك مع OpenClaw\n%2$@\nسيعيد OpenClaw المحاولة تلقائيًا أيضًا عند عودتك إلى هذا التطبيق."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approva questo dispositivo sul gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` nella tua chat OpenClaw\n%2$@\nOpenClaw riproverà anche automaticamente quando tornerai a questa app."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu cihazı Gateway üzerinde onaylayın.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) OpenClaw sohbetinizde `/pair approve`\n%2$@\nBu uygulamaya döndüğünüzde OpenClaw otomatik olarak da yeniden deneyecektir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схваліть цей пристрій на шлюзі.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` у чаті OpenClaw\n%2$@\nOpenClaw також автоматично повторить спробу, коли ви повернетеся до цього застосунку."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Setujui perangkat ini di gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` di obrolan OpenClaw Anda\n%2$@\nOpenClaw juga akan mencoba lagi secara otomatis saat Anda kembali ke aplikasi ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdź to urządzenie na bramie.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` na czacie OpenClaw\n%2$@\nOpenClaw ponowi również próbę automatycznie po powrocie do tej aplikacji."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"อนุมัติอุปกรณ์นี้บน Gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` ในแชท OpenClaw ของคุณ\n%2$@\nOpenClaw จะลองใหม่โดยอัตโนมัติเมื่อคุณกลับมาที่แอปนี้ด้วย."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phê duyệt thiết bị này trên gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` trong cuộc trò chuyện OpenClaw\n%2$@\nOpenClaw cũng sẽ tự động thử lại khi bạn quay lại ứng dụng này."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keur dit apparaat goed op de gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` in je OpenClaw-chat\n%2$@\nOpenClaw probeert het ook automatisch opnieuw wanneer je terugkeert naar deze app."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"این دستگاه را در Gateway تأیید کنید.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` در گفتگوی OpenClaw شما\n%2$@\nOpenClaw همچنین هنگام بازگشت شما به این برنامه، به‌طور خودکار دوباره تلاش می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Одобрите это устройство на Gateway.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` в чате OpenClaw\n%2$@\nOpenClaw также автоматически повторит попытку, когда вы вернётесь в это приложение."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Godkänn den här enheten på gatewayen.\n1) `%1$@`\n2) `/pair approve` i din OpenClaw-chatt\n%2$@\nOpenClaw försöker också igen automatiskt när du återvänder till den här appen."}}}},
    "Archive": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archive"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"归档"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"封存"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arquivar"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivar"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アーカイブ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"보관"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archiver"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आर्काइव करें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أرشفة"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivia"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arşivle"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Архівувати"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arsipkan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archiwizuj"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เก็บถาวร"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lưu trữ"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archiveren"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بایگانی"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Архив"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arkivera"}}}},
